At the call site `doWhileTaskModel.getWorkflowTask()` inside `DoWhile.scheduleNextIteration` / `DoWhile.execute`, `doWhileTaskModel` is a regular `TaskModel` instance whose `workflowTask` field is not enforced to be non-null anywhere in the shown code.

